Version 4
SHEET 1 1300 800
TEXT 64 16 Left 2 ;Resistor crossbar: matrix rows = voltage inputs, columns = current outputs
TEXT 64 48 Left 2 ;Node labels connect identical names without long wires
TEXT 64 80 Left 2 ;Inputs
SYMBOL voltage 64 128 R0
SYMATTR InstName V1
SYMATTR Value 5
FLAG 64 144 row1
FLAG 64 224 0
SYMBOL voltage 64 288 R0
SYMATTR InstName V2
SYMATTR Value 6
FLAG 64 304 row2
FLAG 64 384 0
TEXT 288 80 Left 2 ;Crossbar resistors
SYMBOL res 288 128 R0
SYMATTR InstName R1_1
SYMATTR Value 10000
FLAG 304 144 row1
FLAG 304 224 col1
SYMBOL res 480 128 R0
SYMATTR InstName R1_2
SYMATTR Value 5000
FLAG 496 144 row1
FLAG 496 224 col2
SYMBOL res 288 288 R0
SYMATTR InstName R2_1
SYMATTR Value 3333.33333333
FLAG 304 304 row2
FLAG 304 384 col1
SYMBOL res 480 288 R0
SYMATTR InstName R2_2
SYMATTR Value 2500
FLAG 496 304 row2
FLAG 496 384 col2
TEXT 752 80 Left 2 ;Output current sensors
SYMBOL voltage 752 128 R0
SYMATTR InstName VSENSE1
SYMATTR Value 0
FLAG 752 144 col1
FLAG 752 224 0
SYMBOL voltage 752 288 R0
SYMATTR InstName VSENSE2
SYMATTR Value 0
FLAG 752 304 col2
FLAG 752 384 0
TEXT 64 500 Left 2 !.op
TEXT 64 548 Left 2 ;Check negative of I(VSENSE1), etc. for positive dot products
